# Environment Configuration Template

## Overview
This file provides the complete environment configuration for running the DMP 2026 Multi-tenant SaaS LMS locally.

Copy this template to `.env.local` in your project root and update with your actual values.

---

## Frontend Configuration

```bash
# Next.js Environment (mfes/workspace)
NEXT_PUBLIC_WORKSPACE_PORT=3000
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_GATEWAY=http://localhost:8000
NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_ENABLED=true
NEXT_PUBLIC_TENANT_ID=default-tenant
```

---

## Backend Configuration

### API Gateway (FastAPI)
```bash
# FastAPI Settings
FASTAPI_HOST=0.0.0.0
FASTAPI_PORT=8000
FASTAPI_WORKERS=4
FASTAPI_LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# Environment
ENV=development
DEBUG=true
```

### Database
```bash
# PostgreSQL (for tenant config)
POSTGRES_HOST=localhost
POSTGRES_PORT=5432
POSTGRES_USER=tekdi_user
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=secure_password_change_me
POSTGRES_DB=shiksha_lms_db
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://${POSTGRES_USER}:${POSTGRES_PASSWORD}@${POSTGRES_HOST}:${POSTGRES_PORT}/${POSTGRES_DB}
```

### Redis & Celery
```bash
# Redis (for caching and async queue)
REDIS_HOST=localhost
REDIS_PORT=6379
REDIS_PASSWORD=
REDIS_DB=0
REDIS_URL=redis://${REDIS_HOST}:${REDIS_PORT}/${REDIS_DB}

# Celery Configuration
CELERY_BROKER_URL=${REDIS_URL}
CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND=${REDIS_URL}
CELERY_WORKER_CONCURRENCY=4
CELERY_TASK_TIMEOUT=3600
```

---

## AI Model Configuration

### Ollama (Local LLM Gateway)
```bash
# Ollama Server
OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
OLLAMA_MODEL_TEXT=llama3  # Options: llama3, mistral, neural-chat
OLLAMA_MODEL_EMBEDDINGS=nomic-embed-text
OLLAMA_PULL_ON_START=true
OLLAMA_GPU_ENABLED=true  # Set to false if no NVIDIA GPU

# Model Parameters
OLLAMA_NUM_THREADS=4
OLLAMA_NUM_GPU_LAYERS=50  # GPU layers to use (0 = CPU only)
OLLAMA_CONTEXT_WINDOW=2048  # Maximum tokens

# Fallback to Cloud LLM (Optional)
ENABLE_CLOUD_LLM_FALLBACK=false
OPENAI_API_KEY=  # Leave empty unless using cloud fallback
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o
```

### Whisper (Speech Recognition)
```bash
# Whisper Configuration
WHISPER_MODEL=large-v3  # Options: base, small, medium, large, large-v3
WHISPER_DEVICE=cuda  # Options: cpu, cuda
WHISPER_LANGUAGE=en  # Default language code
WHISPER_TEMPERATURE=0  # For consistency
```

### Model Download Directory
```bash
# Local Model Storage
OLLAMA_MODELS_DIR=/var/lib/ollama/models
WHISPER_MODELS_DIR=/var/lib/whisper/models
```

---

## Service Configuration

### Ingestion Service
```bash
# Ingestion Service (PDF/PPT parsing)
INGESTION_SERVICE_PORT=8001
INGESTION_SERVICE_WORKERS=2
INGESTION_TIMEOUT=300  # 5 minutes for large documents
INGESTION_MAX_FILE_SIZE=52428800  # 50MB

# Processing Settings
ENABLE_OCR=false  # Enable for scanned PDFs
EXTRACT_IMAGES=true
EXTRACT_TABLES=true
```

### Assessment Service
```bash
# Assessment Service (Quiz Generation)
ASSESSMENT_SERVICE_PORT=8002
ASSESSMENT_SERVICE_WORKERS=2
ASSESSMENT_TIMEOUT=180  # 3 minutes for quiz generation

# Question Generation Settings
MCQ_QUESTIONS_LIMIT=15
FILL_BLANK_QUESTIONS_LIMIT=15
MATCH_PAIR_QUESTIONS_LIMIT=10
ENABLE_QUESTION_VALIDATION=true
```

### Multimedia Service
```bash
# Multimedia Service (Transcription)
MULTIMEDIA_SERVICE_PORT=8003
MULTIMEDIA_SERVICE_WORKERS=2
MULTIMEDIA_TIMEOUT=600  # 10 minutes for long videos

# Transcription Settings
ENABLE_DIARIZATION=true
ENABLE_AUTO_CHAPTERING=true
TRANSCRIPTION_CHUNK_SIZE=30  # 30-second chunks
```

### Lesson Builder Service
```bash
# Lesson Builder Service
LESSON_BUILDER_PORT=8004
LESSON_BUILDER_WORKERS=2

# Output Formats
ENABLE_H5P_EXPORT=true
ENABLE_SCORM_EXPORT=true
ENABLE_HTML5_EXPORT=true
```

---

## Multi-Tenant Configuration

### Tenant Management
```bash
# Default Tenant
DEFAULT_TENANT_ID=default-tenant
DEFAULT_TENANT_NAME=Demo Tenant

# Tenant Branding
TENANT_LOGO_URL=https://example.com/logo.png
TENANT_PRIMARY_COLOR=#1976d2
TENANT_SECONDARY_COLOR=#424242
TENANT_FONT_FAMILY=Roboto

# Tenant Isolation
ENABLE_TENANT_ISOLATION=true
ENABLE_MULTI_TENANCY=true
```

---

## Security Configuration

### JWT & Authentication
```bash
# JWT Configuration
JWT_SECRET_KEY=your-super-secret-key-change-this
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_EXPIRATION_HOURS=24

# OAuth (Optional)
ENABLE_OAUTH=false
OAUTH_PROVIDER=google  # Options: google, github, microsoft
OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:3000/auth/callback
```

### Encryption
```bash
# Data Encryption
ENCRYPTION_KEY=your-encryption-key-32-chars
ENCRYPTION_ALGORITHM=AES-256-GCM
```

### CORS
```bash
# CORS Configuration
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:3001,http://localhost:3002
CORS_ALLOW_CREDENTIALS=true
```

---

## Logging & Monitoring

### Logging
```bash
# Logging Configuration
LOG_LEVEL=INFO  # Options: DEBUG, INFO, WARNING, ERROR, CRITICAL
LOG_FORMAT=json  # Options: json, text
LOG_OUTPUT=console,file  # Options: console, file, syslog
LOG_FILE=/var/log/shiksha-lms.log
LOG_MAX_BYTES=10485760  # 10MB
LOG_BACKUP_COUNT=5
```

### Monitoring & Metrics
```bash
# Prometheus Metrics
ENABLE_PROMETHEUS_METRICS=true
PROMETHEUS_PORT=9090

# Health Check
HEALTH_CHECK_INTERVAL=30  # seconds
HEALTH_CHECK_TIMEOUT=10  # seconds
```

---

