## Development Settings

### Feature Flags
```bash
# Feature Toggles
ENABLE_DEMO_MODE=true
ENABLE_DEBUG_ENDPOINTS=true
ENABLE_AI_MOCK_MODE=false  # Use mock responses instead of real LLM
ENABLE_PDF_UPLOAD=true
ENABLE_PPT_UPLOAD=true
ENABLE_VIDEO_UPLOAD=true
ENABLE_AUDIO_UPLOAD=true
```

### Performance Tuning
```bash
# Caching
ENABLE_CACHING=true
CACHE_TTL=3600  # 1 hour
CACHE_BACKEND=redis  # Options: redis, memory, database

# Rate Limiting
ENABLE_RATE_LIMITING=true
RATE_LIMIT_REQUESTS=100
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW=60  # seconds

# Async Processing
MAX_ASYNC_WORKERS=8
ASYNC_TASK_TIMEOUT=1800  # 30 minutes
```

---

